text_en:
Article 43-2 (Corrective order to mobile communications business operators)
The publication under Article 51-3(2)5 of the Act shall include the following matters:
The type of the violation;
Specific contents of the corrective order;
Except as provided in paragraph (1), matters necessary for the methods of publication and other related matters determined and publicly notified by the Korea Media and Communications Commission.
"Matters prescribed by Presidential Decree" in Article 51-3(2)8 of the Act means the following:
Submission of an implementation plan to carry out the measures specified in Article 51-3(2)1 through 7 of the Act;
Report on the implementation results of the measures under Article 51-3(2)1 through 7 of the Act.
"Period prescribed by Presidential Decree" in the main clause of Article 51-3(3) of the Act means the implementation period as specified in Appendix 4-3.
[This Article Added on Apr. 28, 2026]

