Issuance of an order to suspend the use of private telecommunications equipment prescribed in the former part of Article 65(4) of the Act and notification of the fact, under the latter part of the same paragraph, to a Mayor/ Do Governor that an order to suspend the use thereof has been issued;
Inspection of private telecommunications equipment under article 65(5) of the Act;
Issuance of a corrective order under Article 67(1) of the Act;
Issuance of an order to suspend the use of private telecommunications equipment under Article 67(2) of the Act;
Issuance of an order to suspend the use of private telecommunications equipment or to reform or repair them or to take other necessary measures under Article 67(3) of the Act;
Permission for felling and transplantation of plants prescribed in the forepart of Article 75(3) of the Act;
