Types and criteria for the payment of subsidies that constitute unfair discrimination under Article 37-13: January 1, 2026;
Criteria for orders necessary to cease violations under Article 37-18(1): January 1, 2026.
The Minister of Science and ICT and the Korea Media and Communications Commission shall, through consultation, examine the appropriateness of the obligation of mobile communication terminal manufacturers to submit data within the prescribed time limit under Article 37-19(2) every 3 years, counting from January 1, 2026 (referring to the period that ends on the day before January 1 of every 3rd year) and take measures, such as making improvements. <Added on Apr. 28, 2026>
